notes.notes:
[h3]Optimisation: [/h3]
[list]
[*] Changed the colors on the class cards so the cards from different classes can be better identified;
[*] Added search function to the library - you can now search with keywords for cards/talents/items;
[*] Optimised the animation effect of some cards;
[*] Optimised the description of some cards and texts.
[/list]

[h3]Bugfix:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fixed the low drop rate of special runes for Mechanists;
[*] Fixed damage value display problem on the card [Wager];
[*] Fixed the display issue when the card [Poison Rain] triggered the card [Bully] to kill the monster "Evil Dancer";
[*] Fixed the issue where monsters killed by the [Follow-up] buff induced by Evelyn's talent [Cold Hostility] disappeared without damage display;
[*] Fixed the conflict between the talent [Soar] and resurrection items such as Gilded Mask;
[*] Fixed the issue where the displayed damage value did not match the actual damage when you used [Phantom] after a monster copied the highest damage dealt this turn and dealt that damage to you.
[*] Fixed McWood's card limit buff;
[*] Fixed some text errors.
[/list]

[h3]New content:
[/h3]- New skin for Oleg, Keely and Karma!

[h3]Optimisation:
[/h3]- Added "singular" to all non-stackable power cards to indicate that they only work once even when played for multiple times;
- Optimised the visual effects of "Freeze" and "Misfired";
- Optimised the visual effects displayed when you change hero skin;
- All skins are now easier to obtain;
- Partner cards can now also obtain skin effects;
- Optimised the descriptions of some cards and terms.

[h3]Bugfix:
[/h3]- Fixed an issue where Runes cannot be attached to cards that are granted 5 Rune slots by talent "Artisan";
- Fixed an issue where the "Passive Advance" card did not work properly when it was discarded;
- Fixed an issue where the "Hand of Fate" card would take effect multiple times when facing multiple enemies;
- Fixed an issue where Auto cards that were reduced to 0 cost by "Retain+" would be played automatically at the start of turn;
- Fixed an issue where "Purify Rune" could not purify status cards gained by partners;
- Fixed an issue where passively played cards would be treated as your last-played cards;
- Fixed the display of damage dealt by enemy "Fire Elf";
- Fixed an issue where attacking an enemy while it is transforming may cause faulty refresh of Block stats;
- Fixed the event book count;
- Fixed an issue of game getting stuck when transferring to Death Knight;
- Fixed some text errors.

[h3]New prompt:
[/h3]Stories will be marked as completed after you finish them.

[h3]Bugfixes:
[/h3]Fixed the bug where the game got stuck when inviting a partner during story mode;
"Power of Labor" achievement now works;
Fixed the issue where Hawkeye Potion led to boss event.
